{"id":"1b758373302e4229","group":"27","path":"27/27-validation-2026-10-16-r3.md","title":"缺失验证链接的内部形式结构摘要","display":"缺失验证链接的内部形式结构摘要","type":"index","metadata":{"type":"index","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-validation-2026-10-16-r3","aliases":["27-validation-2026-10-16-r3"],"display":"缺失验证链接的内部形式结构摘要","depends_on":["[[27-MOC]]"],"verification_status":"reconstructed-internal-summary-from-supplied-files","local_review_date":"2026-10-20","historical_original_supplied":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"index"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-validation-2026-10-16-r3"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-validation-2026-10-16-r3</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"缺失验证链接的内部形式结构摘要"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5244dbb38da17b8a\" href=\"?note=5244dbb38da17b8a\" title=\"27-MOC\">27-MOC</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reconstructed-internal-summary-from-supplied-files"},{"key":"local_review_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"historical_original_supplied","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>本节点补齐 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5244dbb38da17b8a\" href=\"?note=5244dbb38da17b8a\" title=\"27-MOC\">27-MOC</a> 所列的 r3 历史验证链接；原始日志未提供。本条记录2026-10-20对完整修订目录的文本结构检查。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> 为459个文件的标识集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,A,R\\subseteq\\mathcal F\">\\(H,A,R\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\)</span> 分别为含唯一 Hypothesis、Assertion、Remark 分节的文件集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\mathcal F\">\\(P\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\)</span> 为 Assertion 中所有非空内容都位于显示数学块内且不含汉字或自然语言文本命令的文件集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathcal F\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\)</span> 为文件名、label及主alias一致的文件集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(o\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 表示原始历史日志是否提供，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 表示提供。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"o\\coloneqq0,\\qquad|\\mathcal F|=459.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[o\\coloneqq0,\\qquad|\\mathcal F|=459.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H=A=R=P=L=\\mathcal F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H=A=R=P=L=\\mathcal F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此处仅记录可自动检查的章节、标识和公式块结构。局部数学接口已另行逐条阅读，并对部分有限边界作计算核对；这些工作不应被描述为 Lean、Coq 等证明助手完成的全书机器证明。</p>\n<p>历史 r3 的449条、39条修订、410条保留等数字来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d10bf908ef5dd0f3\" href=\"?note=d10bf908ef5dd0f3\" title=\"27-review-2026-10-16-r3\">27-review-2026-10-16-r3</a> 所复述的原目录段落；本条的459是补齐八份历史摘要后的当前全部文件数，二者口径不同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-MOC","status":"resolved","id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-MOC]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-MOC","status":"resolved","id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本节点补齐 [[27-MOC]] 所列的 r3 历史验证链接；原始日志未提供。本条记录2026-10-20对完整修订目录的文本结构检查。$\\mathcal F$ 为459个文件的标识集合。$H,A,R\\subseteq\\mathcal F$ 分别为含唯一 Hypothesis、Assertion、Remark 分节的文件集合；$P\\subseteq\\mathcal F$ 为 Assertion 中所有非空内容都位于显示数学块内且不含汉字或自然语言文本命令的文件集合；$L\\subseteq\\mathcal F$ 为文件名、label及主alias一致的文件集合。$o\\in\\{0,1\\}$ 表示原始历史日志是否提供，$1$ 表示提供。","embed":false},{"target":"27-review-2026-10-16-r3","status":"resolved","id":"d10bf908ef5dd0f3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"历史 r3 的449条、39条修订、410条保留等数字来自 [[27-review-2026-10-16-r3]] 所复述的原目录段落；本条的459是补齐八份历史摘要后的当前全部文件数，二者口径不同。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"H,A,R\\subseteq\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"o\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"o\\coloneqq0,\\qquad|\\mathcal F|=459.","display":true},{"tex":"H=A=R=P=L=\\mathcal F.","display":true}],"bytes":1622,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-608","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-validation-2026-10-16-r3]]"}],"outgoing":["5244dbb38da17b8a","d10bf908ef5dd0f3"]}